{"t":830,"text":" The Silent Bell"}
{"t":868,"text":"\n\nEvery morning, Mate"}
{"t":897,"text":"o walked to the harbor"}
{"t":935,"text":" with his grandfather to wat"}
{"t":964,"text":"ch the fishing boats come"}
{"t":999,"text":" home. At the end of the d"}
{"t":1031,"text":"ock hung an old brass b"}
{"t":1065,"text":"ell, and it always rang to"}
{"t":1097,"text":" welcome the sailors back"}
{"t":1131,"text":". But on Monday, the"}
{"t":1165,"text":" bell was silent.\n\n\""}
{"t":1198,"text":"Someone has stolen it"}
{"t":1231,"text":"!\" Mateo gas"}
{"t":1265,"text":"ped. His grandfather only"}
{"t":1301,"text":" smiled. \"Mayb"}
{"t":1332,"text":"e,\" he said. \"Or"}
{"t":1365,"text":" maybe there is a good re"}
{"t":1401,"text":"ason. Look closely before you"}
{"t":1432,"text":" decide.\"\n\nMateo"}
{"t":1466,"text":" crouched beside the empty"}
{"t":1501,"text":" post. A few muddy foot"}
{"t":1537,"text":"prints, small ones with z"}
{"t":1566,"text":"igzag patterns, led"}
{"t":1599,"text":" away across the dock. He follow"}
{"t":1633,"text":"ed them past the fish market and"}
{"t":1668,"text":" up to the old net shed."}
{"t":1701,"text":" The door was open just a crack"}
{"t":1733,"text":", and he could hear a qu"}
{"t":1766,"text":"iet scraping sound in"}
{"t":1801,"text":"side.\n\nMateo pe"}
{"t":1835,"text":"eked in. His friend"}
{"t":1869,"text":" Lina was kneeling on"}
{"t":1900,"text":" the floor next to the bell"}
{"t":1933,"text":", twisting a thick new"}
{"t":1967,"text":" rope through its handle."}
{"t":2000,"text":"\n\n\"The storm last night shook"}
{"t":2034,"text":" everything,\" Lina explained"}
{"t":2067,"text":" without looking up. \"I sa"}
{"t":2100,"text":"w that the old rope was fr"}
{"t":2136,"text":"ayed. I was afraid"}
{"t":2168,"text":" the bell would fall on some"}
{"t":2202,"text":"one's head, so I took it"}
{"t":2236,"text":" down to fix it.\""}
{"t":2268,"text":"\n\nMateo felt his che"}
{"t":2303,"text":"eks turn warm. \""}
{"t":2335,"text":"I thought you were a thief"}
{"t":2368,"text":",\" he admitted. \"I"}
{"t":2402,"text":"'m sorry.\""}
{"t":2435,"text":"\n\nLina laughed. \""}
{"t":2471,"text":"Help me carry it back, and"}
{"t":2503,"text":" we'll call it even.\""}
{"t":2538,"text":" Together they hung the bell on"}
{"t":2569,"text":" its post, tugging the r"}
{"t":2603,"text":"ope until the knot was tight"}
{"t":2636,"text":". Then Mateo g"}
{"t":2669,"text":"ave the bell a gentle"}
{"t":2702,"text":" pull. Its deep,"}
{"t":2735,"text":" clear ring rolled across"}
{"t":2770,"text":" the water just as the first fish"}
{"t":2803,"text":"ing boat appeared."}
